// Title: Potential AVKkid.DLL Sideloading
// Rule ID: 952ed57c-8f99-453d-aee0-53a49c22f95d
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.persistence, attack.defense-evasion, attack.privilege-escalation, attack.t1574.001
// Category: image_load
